    <bpmn:process id="W_W4882" name="W4882. Insider-Risk Linkage — Screening to LP/Fraud/Security Event Correlation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Insider event (theft VS-23, fraud VS-125, security VS-159, workplace-violence); periodic correlation
Frequency: Per event + periodic correlation
Volume: ~10–20 insider events per year
Owner: Screening Program Manager / LP (VS-23) / Corporate Security (VS-159)
Participants: Fraud (VS-125), HR, Legal (VS-100.3), Analytics (VS-28)
Source: workflow W4882 — Insider-Risk Linkage — Screening to LP/Fraud/Security Event Correlation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4882_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4882_Lane1" name="LP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4882_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4882_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4882_Lane2" name="Screening Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4882_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4882_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4882_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4882_Start4" name="Insider event (theft VS-23, fraud VS-125, security VS-159, workplace-violence); periodic…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4882_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4882_Task5" name="On an insider event (theft/fraud/security/violence by an…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: On an insider event (theft/fraud/security/violence by an employee/contingent/vendor person), correlate to the individual&#x27;s screening record (was the event foreseeable from screening? a gap? a missed check? a stale screen?) — a post-incident screening-review
Responsible (R): LP / Corporate Security / Screening Program Manager
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Chief Compliance &amp; Security Officer
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4882_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4882_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4882_Task6" name="Identify screening-program improvements: role-package gaps (W4869)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Identify screening-program improvements: role-package gaps (W4869), re-screening gaps (W4877), source-quality issues (W4883), vendor failures (W4884), or consistency gaps (W4878); strengthen controls accordingly
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / LP / Corporate Security
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4882_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4882_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4882_Task7" name="Maintain the insider-risk-screening feed (W4877 triggers): insider-event…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Maintain the insider-risk-screening feed (W4877 triggers): insider-event learnings feed continuous monitoring and triggered re-vet; report correlation findings/trends to governance (W4888), ERM (VS-21.2), and analytics (W4881); support negligent-hiring defense with screening evidence (W4870)
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / Risk / LP / Legal
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4882_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4882_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4882_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4882_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-733 (ensure controlled execution — Screening Analytics, Risk &amp; Program Assurance (PA-167.3).) | - CTL-733 (every insider event screened-correlated; gaps remediated; evidence preserved (W4870))
Owner: Screening Program Manager / LP (VS-23) / Corporate Security (VS-159)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4882_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4882_Annotation9" targetRef="W4882_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4882_Flow11" sourceRef="W4882_Start4" targetRef="W4882_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4882_Flow12" sourceRef="W4882_Task5" targetRef="W4882_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4882_Flow13" sourceRef="W4882_Task6" targetRef="W4882_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4882_Flow14" sourceRef="W4882_Task7" targetRef="W4882_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
