    <bpmn:process id="W_W4883" name="W4883. Screening Fraud &amp; False-Document Detection (Forged Clearances/Credentials)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Suspect document; authenticity-check failure; fraud pattern; vendor source-quality issue
Frequency: Ad hoc + periodic
Volume: ~30–60 suspect documents per year (subset of screens)
Owner: Screening Program Manager / LP (VS-23) / Vendor (W4867)
Participants: Legal (VS-100.3), Security (VS-159), HR, Government Affairs (VS-104)
Source: workflow W4883 — Screening Fraud &amp; False-Document Detection (Forged Clearances/Credentials)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4883_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4883_Lane1" name="Screening Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4883_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4883_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4883_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4883_Lane2" name="LP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4883_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4883_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4883_Start4" name="Suspect document; authenticity-check failure; fraud pattern; vendor source-quality issue">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4883_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4883_Task5" name="Detect false/forged documents: forged NBI clearances, fake police clearances…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Detect false/forged documents: forged NBI clearances, fake police clearances, fabricated employment/education credentials, altered licenses (W1400/W4754/W600); use source-authentication (NBI portal verification, school/employer direct verification, PRC portal), document-forensics, and pattern-detection
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / Vendor / LP
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4883_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4883_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4883_Task6" name="Investigate &amp; decide: verify via the issuing source, document the fraud, route…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Investigate &amp; decide: verify via the issuing source, document the fraud, route to the Adverse-Action Board (W4880 — disqualification), and where material, escalate to LP (VS-23) and Legal (VS-100.3) for possible legal action (falsification of documents)
Responsible (R): LP / Legal / Screening Program Manager
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4883_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4883_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4883_Task7" name="Manage vendor source-quality (W4867/W4884) and report fraud-trends (rising…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage vendor source-quality (W4867/W4884) and report fraud-trends (rising forgery?) to governance (W4888), analytics (W4881), and Government Affairs (VS-104) where systemic; strengthen verification controls
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / LP / Analytics
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4883_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4883_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4883_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4883_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-733 (ensure controlled execution — Screening Analytics, Risk &amp; Program Assurance (PA-167.3).) | - CTL-733: source-authentication for high-risk documents; fraud investigated; disqualification/legal action where warranted
Owner: Screening Program Manager / LP (VS-23) / Vendor (W4867)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4883_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4883_Annotation9" targetRef="W4883_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4883_Flow11" sourceRef="W4883_Start4" targetRef="W4883_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4883_Flow12" sourceRef="W4883_Task5" targetRef="W4883_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4883_Flow13" sourceRef="W4883_Task6" targetRef="W4883_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4883_Flow14" sourceRef="W4883_Task7" targetRef="W4883_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
