    <bpmn:process id="W_W4884" name="W4884. Screening-Vendor/Agency Risk Management &amp; TPRM" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor onboarding (W4867); periodic TPRM cycle; performance/quality/fraud issue
Frequency: Continuous + periodic TPRM
Volume: ~5–8 screening vendors + agencies (contingent VS-98)
Owner: Screening Program Manager / TPRM (VS-161) / Procurement (VS-03/VS-34)
Participants: Security (VS-159), Privacy (VS-91), Legal (VS-100.3), Finance
Source: workflow W4884 — Screening-Vendor/Agency Risk Management &amp; TPRM</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4884_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4884_Lane1" name="TPRM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4884_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4884_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4884_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4884_Lane2" name="Screening Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4884_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4884_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4884_Start4" name="Vendor onboarding (W4867); periodic TPRM cycle; performance/quality/fraud issue">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4884_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4884_Task5" name="Manage screening-vendor/agency risk per the enterprise TPRM (VS-161): tiering…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Manage screening-vendor/agency risk per the enterprise TPRM (VS-161): tiering by criticality/sensitivity (screening providers handle criminal/credit data — high-sensitivity), cyber-attestation, financial DD, privacy/DPA compliance (W4867/W4868), concentration limits, and resilience/exit
Responsible (R): TPRM / Screening Program Manager / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4884_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4884_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4884_Task6" name="Monitor vendor/agency performance &amp; compliance (SLA W4870, accuracy W4883…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Monitor vendor/agency performance &amp; compliance (SLA W4870, accuracy W4883, ABC/anti-corruption VS-86, privacy VS-91, data-security), and manage issues (quality drop, fraud, breach) with corrective action or exit
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / TPRM / Privacy
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4884_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4884_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4884_Task7" name="Manage concentration/resilience: avoid single-vendor criticality, maintain…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage concentration/resilience: avoid single-vendor criticality, maintain backup capability, and plan exit (data return/destruction); feed vendor-risk to TPRM (VS-161), governance (W4888), and analytics (W4881)
Responsible (R): TPRM / Screening Program Manager / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4884_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4884_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4884_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
