        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-733 (ensure controlled execution — Screening Analytics, Risk &amp; Program Assurance (PA-167.3).) | - CTL-733: vendors tiered &amp; TPRM&#x27;d; performance monitored; concentration limits; exit planned
Owner: Screening Program Manager / TPRM (VS-161) / Procurement (VS-03/VS-34)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
