Frequency: Continuous + on change
Volume: ~2–4 regulatory changes per year affecting screening
Owner: Screening Program Manager / Legal (VS-100.3) / DPO (VS-91) / Government Affairs (VS-104)
Participants: HR Policy, Labor Relations (VS-84), Compliance Portfolio (VS-166)
Source: workflow W4886 — Regulatory Change Monitoring (DOLE/NPC/NBI/PNP) &amp; Policy Update</bpmn:documentation>
