      <bpmn:userTask id="W4886_Task5" name="Monitor regulatory change affecting screening: DOLE labor/OSH (W4879…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monitor regulatory change affecting screening: DOLE labor/OSH (W4879 drug-testing rules VS-150), NPC/RA 10173 (consent, retention, DSAR, breach — W4868/W4872), NBI/PNP clearance rules, PRC/TESDA verification, fair-chance/anti-discrimination developments, and cross-border data (W4879/VS-160)
Responsible (R): Legal / DPO / Government Affairs / Screening Program Manager
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / DPO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4886_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4886_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4886_Task6" name="Assess impact &amp; update policy (W4866): change consent language, retention…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Assess impact &amp; update policy (W4866): change consent language, retention rules, packages, or the adverse-action framework (W4880) to comply; communicate to HR/vendors/agencies
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / Legal / DPO / HR Policy
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4886_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4886_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4886_Task7" name="Track adoption to closure and report to governance (W4888); capture emerging…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Track adoption to closure and report to governance (W4888); capture emerging regulatory risk for ERM (VS-21.2) and the compliance portfolio (VS-166)
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / Legal / Risk
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4886_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
