        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-733 (ensure controlled execution — Screening Analytics, Risk &amp; Program Assurance (PA-167.3).) | - CTL-733: maturity assessed annually; improvement pipeline managed; benefit realized &amp; reported
Owner: CHRO / Chief Compliance &amp; Security Officer / Screening Program Manager</bpmn:text>
